# One identity per person in `git shortlog -sne`, `git log --use-mailmap`
# and `git blame`. Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> [Commit Name] <commit@email>
# A line with only the canonical name and email renames every commit made
# with that email, whatever name it was made under.

